{"4904060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roll and Die", "steam_appid": 4904060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4904160], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The house always wins. So far.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You would not stay dead, so the god of luck made you his favorite bet. Roll &amp; Die is a push-your-luck dice roguelite about climbing out of the Pit: through his champions, through his tricks, and finally through the god himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/dfade0886898b9d2b30f497eec9c8c6b.poster.avif?t=1788202292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/dfade0886898b9d2b30f497eec9c8c6b.webm?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/dfade0886898b9d2b30f497eec9c8c6b.mp4?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll, keep, push, bust</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw real dice across the sand, keep the faces you like, then push your luck to reroll the rest and climb your Fervor multiplier. Bigger multiplier, bigger blow. But one Skull too many and the turn is gone. Greed gets you power. Greed gets you killed. You pick one, every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/134a5a5ac8c417c2d127ddf39ca37201.poster.avif?t=1788202292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/134a5a5ac8c417c2d127ddf39ca37201.webm?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/134a5a5ac8c417c2d127ddf39ca37201.mp4?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get greedy, get strong.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge new dice, stack relics that reward the bold, and once a fight you can cheat the god and force a die to its best face. Win Glory at the table and bank it into permanent upgrades, so every death leaves you harder to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/b14b43e18f50ab3f3fa2707cfa44d240.poster.avif?t=1788202292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/b14b43e18f50ab3f3fa2707cfa44d240.webm?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/b14b43e18f50ab3f3fa2707cfa44d240.mp4?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb to the god who runs it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching road of duels, elite champions, forges and omens, where every foe bends a rule and three floors stand between you and RNGesus. All under a warm PS1 haze: chunky low-poly 3D, pixel art, and an arena that does not want you to leave.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The house always wins. So far.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You would not stay dead, so the god of luck made you his favorite bet. Roll &amp; Die is a push-your-luck dice roguelite about climbing out of the Pit: through his champions, through his tricks, and finally through the god himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass