43e18f50ab3f3fa2707cfa44d240.poster.avif?t=1788202292\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/b14b43e18f50ab3f3fa2707cfa44d240.webm?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/extras/b14b43e18f50ab3f3fa2707cfa44d240.mp4?t=1788202292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb to the god who runs it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching road of duels, elite champions, forges and omens, where every foe bends a rule and three floors stand between you and RNGesus. All under a warm PS1 haze: chunky low-poly 3D, pixel art, and an arena that does not want you to leave.</p>", "short_description": "A push-your-luck dice roguelite. Greed gets you power. Greed gets you killed. Keep the rolls you like, push the rest, and pray you do not hit a skull. Climb the Pit to the god who runs it.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/bd9e0802784bc6ef7b8f93262b3d8f1fba1ca31b/header.jpg?t=1788202292", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/1f2dc77588e9ebad83a7d1f995fedf1fca198066/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788202292", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4904060/1f2dc77588e9ebad83a7d1f995fedf1fca198066/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788202292", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>G